WEBVTT

00:03:28.675 --> 00:03:32.703
nente, tete, shtate, gjashte --

00:03:32.703 --> 00:03:35.251
(Anija kozmike pergatitet per t'u ngritur)

00:03:35.251 --> 00:03:38.143
-- fillo, dy, nje,

00:03:38.143 --> 00:03:42.286
ndizen motoret, 
dhe ngrihet anija kozmike Discovery,

00:03:42.286 --> 00:03:46.317
duke u kthyer tek stacioni hapesinor, 
duke hapur rrugen

00:03:46.317 --> 00:03:57.884
(Anija kozmike po ngrihet)

00:03:58.901 --> 00:04:01.161
CH: Eshte pabesueshmerisht e fuqishme